   "verbJa": "遅れる",
   "verbSense": "be late; fall behind time",
   "englishVerb": "delayed",
   "trap": "Not densha ga chikoku suru (chikoku is people being late for school or work), and not densha ga osoi for reporting a delay: osoi works as a grumble while you wait (basu osoi ne = the bus is late), but a train running behind schedule, the one you message about, is okureteru. densha osoi can also just mean a slow train.",
   "partners": [
