   "verb": "maniau",
   "verbJa": "間に合う",
   "verbSense": "be in time (for something); be enough",
   "englishVerb": "catch",
   "trap": "Not densha o tsukamaeru or densha o toru: making a train in time is ni maniau ('be in time for'). 'I missed the train' is not misu shita (misu is a mistake): say maniawanakatta or nogashita.",
   "partners": [
